title: Clean up stale GRANDPA current-round state on startup

doc:
  - audience: Node Operator
    description: |
      Remove persisted GRANDPA current-round entries at or below the last completed round when a
      node starts. This includes entries containing old votes, preventing leaked legacy state from
      remaining large and being rewritten with every subsequent vote.

crates:
  - name: sc-consensus-grandpa
    bump: patch
